      "message": "Hey Kai, does this approach look good to you?\n\nGregg is adding tests for this at https://github.com/gpuweb/cts/pull/4427 which should tell us which backend need to be updated. I\u0027ve started with macOS as I have a machine to try it out locally. I\u0027ve also tried Vulkan with `forceFallbackAdapter` in the CTS and it seems to pass.",
